+| **K-8** | Nama badan usaha (3 PT) | belum | **belum** | `bootstrap.py:243,251` masih `PT Kain Suka Cita` + `CV Kanda Suka` — dua entitas, nama lama. Klien meminta **tiga**: Kanda Fabric, Sukacita Textile, Cipta Sandang Textile |
+| **K-9** | **Varian produk dari R&D** | belum | ✅ **SELESAI** | §1.1 & §1.2 |
+
+**PERINTAH CEK — jalankan semuanya sekaligus:**
+```bash
+ls backend/services/text_normalize.py 2>/dev/null || echo "K-1 belum"
+grep -q "field_validator" backend/schemas.py && grep -qi "phone" backend/schemas.py || echo "K-2 belum"
+grep -q "a.address" frontend/src/features/pos/CheckoutStep3.jsx || echo "K-3 belum"
+grep -q "NET60" backend/services/config_service.py || echo "K-4 belum"
+grep -q "cart.map" frontend/src/features/pos/CheckoutStep3.jsx || echo "K-6 belum"
